ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"义","pinyin":"yì","traditional":"義","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Bing Hiancu berkata, \"Seorang yang mempunyai kuda dan kereta tidak seharusnya ribut akan soal ayam dan babi; seorang yang berkedudukan tinggi tidak seharusnya ribut akan soal kerbau dan kambing; dan seorang pembesar yang dapat mengurus seratus kereta perang tidak seharusnya memakai pegawai yang suka memeras rakyat. Daripada mempunyai pegawai yang suka memeras rakyat lebih baik mempunyai pegawai yang suka mencuri. Inilah yang dikatakan bahwa negara janganlah menganggap keuntungan sebagai Keberuntungan, tetapi pandanglah Kebenaran sebagai Keberuntungan. (Shi Jing - Si King I.15.1.8.;SS XI:17)"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.11.23","number":23,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"长","pinyin":"zhǎng","traditional":"長","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditional":"家","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"务","pinyin":"wù","traditional":"務","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"财","pinyin":"cái","traditional":"財","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yòng","traditional":"用","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiǎo","traditional":"小","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"bǐ","traditional":"彼","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xiǎo","traditional":"小","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shǐ","traditional":"使","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditional":"家","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"灾","pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"災","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hài","traditional":"害","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"并","pinyin":"bìng","traditional":"並","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"虽","pinyin":"suī","traditional":"雖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"亦","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hé","traditional":"何","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"义","pinyin":"yì","traditional":"義","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Pemimpin negara yang hanya mengutamakan harta saja, menunjukkan dia seorang rendah budi. Jika perbuatan rendah budi dianggap baik, maka akan datanglah malapetaka bagi negara itu. Bila hal ini sudah terjadi meski datang seorang yang Baik, iapun tidak akan dapat berbuat apa-apa lagi. Maka dikatakan 'suatu negara janganlah menganggap keuntungan sebagai Keberuntungan, tetapi pandanglah Kebenaran sebagai Keberuntungan.' (Bc. IA:1). Zhong Yong - Tiong Yong ( Tengah Sempurna ) KATA PENGANTAR CU-HI Guruku Chengzi - Thiacu berkata, \"Yang tidak menyeleweng dinamai Tengah, yang tidak berubah dinamai Sempurna. Tengah itulah Jalan Lurus dunia dan Sempurna itulah Hukum Tetap bagi dunia. Kitab ini berisi ajaran rokhani pemeluk Agama Khonghucu. Zisi (Cusu) (Khong Khiep, cucu Nabi Kongzi - Khongcu) khawatir lama kelamaan akan berkurang isinya, maka dibukukan untuk diserahkan kepada Mengzi - Bingcu. Kitab ini mula-mula membicarakan tentang Satu Hukum, lalu dibentangkan sampai meliputi berlaksa perkara dan akhirnya dikembalikan menjadi Satu Hukum. Ajaran ini bila diuraikan akan meliputi enam penjuru, bila diringkas akan balik tersembunyi ke alam gaib. Sari ajarannya tidak pernah habis dan semuanya berisi ajaran nyata. Yang dapat baik-baik membacanya, sehingga memperoleh sarinya, akan dapat memakainya sepanjang hidup dan tidak dapat menghabiskannya. TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB UTAMA"}],"source_file":"01 - Da Xue 大學/11 - Bab X - Teratur Negara Damai Dunia.md","title":"Bab X — Teratur Negara Damai Dunia"}
